{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A MINIMALIST COLORFUL LANDSCAPE BUILDER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655260/extras/ebf101091325302eaa5f6ebc5288f5a7.poster.avif?t=1752700129\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655260/extras/ebf101091325302eaa5f6ebc5288f5a7.webm?t=1752700129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655260/extras/ebf101091325302eaa5f6ebc5288f5a7.mp4?t=1752700129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf33 Paint the terrain and place natural elements to <strong>grow a beautiful landscape tile by tile</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udeb8 Discover <strong>many biomes</strong> organized in <strong>three main climates</strong>: temperate, polar and tropical</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d Never compose the same landscape twice with <strong>procedurally generated archipelagos</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcaf Leverage <strong>various intuitive placement rules</strong> to maximize your <strong>score</strong> and your <strong>strategy</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Appreciate <strong>colorful 3D pixel art visuals</strong> with <strong>dynamic lightning</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd4a\ufe0f Enjoy a <strong>relaxing</strong> and <strong>peaceful experience</strong> that you can come back to once in a while</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 Unleash <strong>your creativity</strong> and watch <strong>your tiny landscape</strong> slowly getting back to life</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655260/extras/e172a227b9ec11688abd2ecc582d4f6e.avif?t=1752700129\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT RADIANT SLOTH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Radiant Sloth (he/him) is a <strong>solo indie game developer</strong> from France, He has a passion for creating <strong>inspiring and entertaining art</strong>, and is committed to <strong>ethical and sustainable game development</strong>. In particular, he strives to maintain <strong>honest and transparent communication</strong> with the community, advocates <strong>awareness of carbon footprint</strong> and climate issues, and <strong>bans generative AI tools</strong> from his creation process.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3655260?t=1752700129","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3655260?t=1752700129","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655260/ee7589573f970dc534370635f50f18b8c4cdec7c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752700129","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655260/ee7589573f970dc534370635f50f18b8c4cdec7c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752700129","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3706310,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A MI